@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam Padding 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
title Room lifecycle reconstructed from code
state "Waiting room" as Waiting
state "Match in progress" as Playing
state "Results / waiting for acknowledgements" as Results
[*] --> Waiting : CreateRoom
Waiting --> Playing : TryStartGame: at least 2 players\nTryStartCoopGame: 4 players (2 vs 2)
Playing --> Results : DEAD handling finds a winner
Results --> Waiting : All current members READY_TO_EXIT\nisInGame = false; GAME_END
note bottom of Results
Results is a conceptual phase.
Stored fields are isInGame, deadUsersByRoom and readyUsersByRoom.
end note
@enduml
